{"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n<title>lfr 0.1: newsletters on a $5 VPS</title>\n<style>\nbody{margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){\n.lfr-bg{background:#18181b!important}\n.lfr-card{background:#27272a!important;color:#e4e4e7!important}\n.lfr-card h1,.lfr-card h2,.lfr-card h3,.lfr-card h4{color:#fafafa!important}\n.lfr-card pre,.lfr-card code{background:#3f3f46!important}\n.lfr-muted,.lfr-muted a{color:#d4d4d8!important}\n}\n@media (max-width:620px){.lfr-card{padding:24px 18px!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"lfr-bg\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f5;\">\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" class=\"lfr-bg\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f4f5;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;\">\n<tr><td class=\"lfr-muted\" style=\"padding:0 4px 8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#52525b;\">One binary, ten DNS records, a relay for the last hop</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"lfr-muted\" style=\"padding:0 4px 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#3f3f46;\"><a href=\"https://news.lfr.email\" class=\"lfr-muted\" style=\"color:#3f3f46;text-decoration:none;\">lfr notes</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"lfr-card\" style=\"background:#fffffe;border-radius:8px;padding:32px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#27272a;text-align:left;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:28px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#18181b;\">lfr 0.1 is out</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;\">lfr runs newsletters, their websites and plain mailboxes for many domains from one binary on a small server. Your agent operates it from the terminal; there is no admin interface to keep patched.</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#18181b;\">What is in it</h2>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px;padding:0 0 0 24px;\">\n<li style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\"><strong>Issues from Markdown.</strong> Write a file, run <code style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:14px;background:#f4f4f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:4px;\">lfr issue put</code>, send a test copy to yourself, schedule it.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\"><strong>The boring parts done right.</strong> Double opt-in, one-click unsubscribe, unsubscribe by reply, bounce handling, and a pause when complaints climb.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\"><strong>A route around port 25.</strong> Most cloud servers cannot send on port 25. lfr signs every message itself and hands it to a relay such as Amazon SES for the last hop.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#18181b;\">Try it</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;\">Install it on a fresh server and point one domain at it. The ten records it prints are the only DNS work.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Anonyfox/lfr/blob/main/docs/operations.md\" style=\"color:#0f766e;text-decoration:underline;display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:6px;background:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\" class=\"lfr-button\">Read the setup guide \u2192</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;\">What would make you move your newsletter? Reply to this mail; it reaches me, not a robot.</p>\n\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"lfr-muted\" style=\"padding:20px 4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#52525b;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">You receive this because you subscribed to lfr notes.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\"><a href=\"https://news.lfr.email/u/ek002pqqk7g1bagbgc2aq\" style=\"color:#52525b;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://news.lfr.email/issues/first-notes\" style=\"color:#52525b;text-decoration:underline;\">View in browser</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Forwarded to you? Subscribe at <a href=\"https://news.lfr.email/\" style=\"color:#52525b;text-decoration:underline;\">news.lfr.email</a></p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "subject": "lfr 0.1: newsletters on a $5 VPS", "from": "lfr notes <notes@lfr.email>"}